Yeah, but we think we called out on the 1989 Best Of episode that we're gonna like, find out what game was closest to when we were born and then that will be the game that you must play for the rest of your life.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.460
I can't wait. Hopefully it's a good one.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.680
I mean, you can roll the dice.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.320
