00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:25.860
And when they give you these two characters, uh, you're, you're kind of like the controller is fighting with itself to control them all.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:37.980
And, um, it almost, it's almost like compared to the two player that I've seen, um, playing as both Orin and Cutris, the name of the bird.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:42.000
It's kind of like you get your arm tied behind your back or something.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:47.000
Yeah, I think that there was, well, I, I, let me, let me ask you guys this.

