00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.060
You can't move the Falcon.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:10.480
I mean, unless I missed how to do it, you can't control where the Falcon is going while you're quote unquote controlling the Falcon.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:14.640
