00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:19.780
If, you know, if you're scoring this thing, uh, on a scale, like I would say like one point alone is just for the fact that like a, another player can jump in and actually do something that isn't just being, you know, another, uh, or in.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:26.320
Yeah. And we give, we, we give multiplayer games a lot of credit on this show.

