00:12:55.040 --> 00:13:11.200
Um, but it's, it's just funny because like, there's this whole convolution for the, the game in the American version, but it's very simple in, in the original version where it just like, it just is the 1800s.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:22.560
1800s. And you know, what's interesting too about like, forget even the whole like plot difference of 1800s versus like distant future after a nuclear apocalypse.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:31.300
After the nuclear apocalypse, I'm supposed to believe that like all of these countries just exists exactly the same way that they always did.

